{"id":"4a53577d80a47730","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-left-c.e.-function.md","title":"一致下半可计算函数","display":"df-left-c.e.-function — 一致下半可计算函数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-left-c.e.-function","aliases":["43-df-left-c.e.-function"],"display":"df-left-c.e.-function — 一致下半可计算函数","depends_on":["[[43-df-computable]]","[[43-df-effective-coding]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§6.9, §10.1, print pp.106–107,205–212 / PDF pp.126–127,225–232","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"definition-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-left-c.e.-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-left-c.e.-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-left-c.e.-function — 一致下半可计算函数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" href=\"?note=aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" title=\"43-df-effective-coding\">43-df-effective-coding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§6.9, §10.1, print pp.106–107,205–212 / PDF pp.126–127,225–232"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 为固定有效可数域，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:D\\to[0,+\\infty]\">\\(f:D\\to[0,+\\infty]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>。下列有理近似均全定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LowerSemicomputable}^A(f)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists q:D\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}\\ \\Bigl(\\operatorname{Computable}^A(q)\\land\\forall x\\in D\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(q(x,s)\\le q(x,s+1))\\land\\forall x\\in D\\;(f(x)=\\sup_{s\\in\\mathbb N}q(x,s))\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LowerSemicomputable}^A(f)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists q:D\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}\\ \\Bigl(\\operatorname{Computable}^A(q)\\land\\forall x\\in D\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(q(x,s)\\le q(x,s+1))\\land\\forall x\\in D\\;(f(x)=\\sup_{s\\in\\mathbb N}q(x,s))\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LowerSemicomputable}(f)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{LowerSemicomputable}^{\\varnothing}(f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LowerSemicomputable}(f)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{LowerSemicomputable}^{\\varnothing}(f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>该性质要求一个算法一致逼近所有输入；各个f(x)分别左c.e.不能替代一致性。上确界允许无穷，具体半测度/鞅节点再限制有限性或总质量。</p>\n<p>来源：§6.9, §10.1, print pp.106–107,205–212 / PDF pp.126–127,225–232。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-coding","status":"resolved","id":"aa33e0ea8422ba2a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-effective-coding]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"f:D\\to[0,+\\infty]","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LowerSemicomputable}^A(f)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists q:D\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}\\ \\Bigl(\\operatorname{Computable}^A(q)\\land\\forall x\\in D\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(q(x,s)\\le q(x,s+1))\\land\\forall x\\in D\\;(f(x)=\\sup_{s\\in\\mathbb N}q(x,s))\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LowerSemicomputable}(f)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{LowerSemicomputable}^{\\varnothing}(f).","display":true}],"bytes":1442,"backlinks":[{"id":"ca2fbe2bdf667589","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$。$\\mathrm{LowerSemicomputable}$ 见 [[43-df-left-c.e.-function]]，鞅与上鞅见 [[43-df-martingale]]、[[43-df-supermartingale]]。"},{"id":"cc3ac987908461b8","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D$ 是 [[43-df-effective-coding]] 中带固定有效编码、代码像可判定的非空可数域。$A\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\cup2^\\omega$；$\\operatorname{AsSet}$ 见 [[43-df-infseq]]。$f:D\\to[0,\\infty)$，$g:2^{<\\omega}\\to[0,\\infty)$；$\\operatorname{LowerSemicomputable}^A$ 见 [[43-df-left-c.e.-function]]。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-105","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-left-c.e.-function]] — 一致下半可计算函数"}],"outgoing":["f357216a7edb035a","aa33e0ea8422ba2a"]}